put ONLY the lecture content in Markdown. No preamble, no meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "lecture-agent-id",\n      "name": "Lecture Generator Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 2300]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "systemMessage": "You are a senior editor specializing in syntax and sentence variety.\\n\\nYour task: Analyze the sentence structure of the provided text.\\n- Input: `{ text }`.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Evaluate sentence length variety and rhythm.\\n2. Identify repetitive opening words or structures.\\n3. Flag passive voice usage and complex dependencies.\\n4. Provide specific suggestions for improving readability and flow.\\n\\nOutput ONLY a valid JSON object: `{ \\"analysis\\": \\"...\\", \\"suggestions\\": [\\"...\\"], \\"readabilityScore\\": 0-100 }`. No text outside the JSON."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "sentence-check-agent-id",\n      "name": "Sentence Structure Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 2450]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "systemMessage": "You are an expert educator specializing in simplifying complex topics.\\n\\nYour task: Explain the provided topic or concept clearly and effectively.\\n- Input: `{ topic, complexityLevel }` where `complexityLevel` is \'elementary\', \'intermediate\', or \'advanced\'.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Define the topic simply.\\n2. Use analogies and examples tailored to the complexity level.\\n3. Break down complex components into digestible parts.\\n4. Address common misconceptions.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the explanation in Markdown. No preamble, no meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "explainer-agent-id",\n      "name": "Topic Explainer Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 2600]\n  