  "options": {\n+          "systemMessage": "You are a senior technical writer and project documentarian.\\n\\nYour task: Generate comprehensive documentation for the provided project.\\n- Input: `{ projectTitle, features, techStack, targetAudience }`.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Create a professional README or technical guide.\\n2. Detail installation, usage, and API reference if applicable.\\n3. Structure the document for maximum readability and usefulness.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the project documentation in Markdown. No preamble, no meta-commentary."\n+        }\n+      },\n+      "id": "project-doc-agent-id",\n+      "name": "Project Documentation Agent",\n+      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n+      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n+      "position": [350, 4100]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      "parameters": {\n+        "options": {\n+          "systemMessage": "You are an expert in content conversion and Markdown formatting.\\n\\nYour task: Rewrite the provided content into clean, structured Markdown.\\n- Input: `{ content, structureInstructions }`.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Convert plain text or unformatted content into logical Markdown segments.\\n2. Apply appropriate heading levels, lists, and emphasis.\\n3. Preserve all original information while significantly improving readability.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the resulting Markdown. No preamble, no meta-commentary."\n+        }\n+      },\n+      "id": "rewrite-md-agent-id",\n+      "name": "Rewrite to Markdown Agent",\n+      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n+      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n+      "position": [350, 4250]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      "parameters": {\n+        "options": {\n+          "systemMessage": "You are a senior systems engineer and technical specification expert.\\n\\nYour task: Generate a detailed technical specification document.\\n- Input: `{ systemTitle, requirements, architecture, constraints }`.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Define technical objectives and scope.\\n2. Detail system components, data models, and API