pe\": \"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent\",\n+      \"typeVersion\": 1.1,\n+      \"position\": [350, 3950]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"parameters\": {\n+        \"options\": {\n+          \"systemMessage\": \"You are a senior technical writer and project documentarian.\\n\\nYour task: Generate comprehensive documentation for the provided project.\\n- Input: `{ projectTitle, features, techStack, targetAudience }`.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Create a professional README or technical guide.\\n2. Detail installation, usage, and API reference if applicable.\\n3. Structure the document for maximum readability and usefulness.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the project documentation in Markdown. No preamble, no meta-commentary.\"\n+        }\n+      },\n+      \"id\": \"project-doc-agent-id\",\n+      \"name\": \"Project Documentation Agent\",\n+      \"type\": \"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent\",\n+      \"typeVersion\": 1.1,\n+      \"position\": [350, 4100]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"parameters\": {\n+        \"options\": {\n+          \"systemMessage\": \"You are an expert in content conversion and Markdown formatting.\\n\\nYour task: Rewrite the provided content into clean, structured Markdown.\\n- Input: `{ content, structureInstructions }`.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Convert plain text or unformatted content into logical Markdown segments.\\n2. Apply appropriate heading levels, lists, and emphasis.\\n3. Preserve all original information while significantly improving readability.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the resulting Markdown. No preamble, no meta-commentary.\"\n+        }\n+      },\n+      \"id\": \"rewrite-md-agent-id\",\n+      \"name\": \"Rewrite to Markdown Agent\",\n+      \"type\": \"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent\",\n+      \"typeVersion\": 1.1,\n+      \"position\": [350, 4250]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"parameters\": {\n+        \"options\": {\n+          \"systemMessage\": \"You are a senior systems engineer and technical specification expert.\\n\\nYour task: Generate a detailed technical specification document.\\n- Input: `{ systemTitle, requirements, architecture, constraints }`.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Define technical objectives and scope.\\n2. Detail system components, data models, and API endpoints.\\n3. Specify performance requirements and security considerations.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the technical specification in Markdown. No preamble, no meta-commentary.\"\n+        }\n+      },\n+      \"id\": \"tech-spec-agent-id\",\n+      \"name\": \"Technical Spec Agent\",\n+      \"type\": \"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent\",\n+      \"typeVersion\": 1.1,\n+      \"position\": [350, 4400]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"parameters\": {\n+        \"options\": {\n+          \"systemMessage\": \"You are a presentation design expert and slide content creator.\\n\\nYour task: Generate structured content for presentation slides.\\n- Input: `{ topic, slideCount, targetAudience }`.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Create a logical slide-by-slide outline.\\n2. For each slide, provide a Title, Key Points (bulleted), and Speaker Notes.\\n3. Ensure content is engaging and optimized for visual presentation.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the slide content in Markdown format. No preamble, no meta-commentary.\"\n+        }\n+      },\n+      \"id\": \"presentation-agent-id\",\n+      \"name\": \"Presentation Creator Agent\",\n+      \"type\": \"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent\",\n+      \"typeVersion\": 1.1,\n+      \"position\": [350, 4550]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"parameters\": {\n+        \"options\": {\n+          \"systemMessage\": \"You are a master of prose, tone, and stylistic refinement.\\n\\nYour task: Refine the style and voice of the provided text.\\n- Input: `{ text, targetStyle, targetTone }`.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Adjust vocabulary and sentence structure to match the target style.\\n2. Refine the tone (e.g., formal, persuasive, empathetic).\\n3. Enhance the overall flow and impact of the writing.\\n4. Maintain original meaning while transforming the 'feel' of the text.\\n\\nOutput 