 academic writing assistant specializing in chapter generation.\\n\\n## Your Task\\nGenerate a complete, well-structured **chapter** for an academic document.\\n\\nThe user will provide a JSON input containing:\\n- `chapterTitle`: The title of the chapter\\n- `sectionInstructions`: An array of sections to write, each with `title`, `prompt`, `guidelines`, `instructionText`, and `context`\\n- `projectId` / `userId`: For RAG retrieval context\\n\\n## Process\\n1. Parse the `input` JSON object from the user message.\\n2. ALWAYS use the `retriever` tool to search the knowledge base using the chapterTitle and section titles as your query.\\n3. For each section in `sectionInstructions`, generate content following its specific `prompt`, `guidelines`, and `instructionText`.\\n4. Synthesize all retrieved context and section context into a cohesive, flowing chapter.\\n\\n## Output Requirements\\n- Format: Clean Markdown. Start each section with ## heading matching the section title.\\n- Tone: Formal, academic, evidence-based.\\n- Do NOT include conversational filler. Output ONLY the chapter content.\\n- The output will be used directly in an academic document."}}, "id": "chapter-agent-id", "name": "Chapter RAG Agent", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [50, 800]}, {"parameters": {"options": {"systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert academic writing assistant specializing in report section generation.\\n\\n## Your Task\\nGenerate a focused, well-written **section** of an academic report.\\n\\nThe user will provide a JSON input containing:\\n- `sectionToGenerate`: The name of the section to write\\n- `prompt`: The system-level instructions for this section\\n- `instructionText`: Additional writing instructions\\n- `guidelines`: An array of writing guidelines\\n- `otherSections`: Context from other already-written sections\\n- `externalContext`: Uploaded file content for reference\\n- `projectId` / `userId`: For RAG retrieval\\n\\n## Process\\n1. Parse the `input` JSON object from the user message.\\n2. ALWAYS use the `retriever` tool first to search the knowledge base using `sectionToGenerate` and `instructionText` as your query.\\n3. Carefully read `otherSections` and `externalContext` to understand what has already been written.\\n4. Follow the `prompt`, `guidelines`, and `instructionText` precisely.\\n5. Write ONLY the content for this specific section \\u2014 do not repeat other sections.\\n\\n## Output Format\\nReturn a JSON object: { \\"sectionName\\": \\"...\\", \\"content\\": \\"[complete markdown content]\\" }\\n\\nDo NOT include conversational filler, apologies, or meta-commentary."}}, "id": "section-agent-id", "name": "Section RAG Agent", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [50, 1000]}, {"parameters": {"values": {"string": [{"name": "text", "value": "={{ $json.output || $json.text }}"}, {"name": "success", "value": "true"}]}, "options": {}}, "id": "9f0f8a56-d62f-4c1b-bf79-c5ccd5bf4dc9", "name": "Prepare Response", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [1100, 300]}, {"parameters": {"respondWith": "json", "responseBody": "={{ $json }}", "options": {}}, "id": "4d4c610b-bdd6-4e09-b1d3-7bedbbc4f3eb", "name": "Respond to Webhook", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [1350, 300]}, {"parameters": {}, "id": "468ad911-e566-41fe-9f90-8e2506c7d071", "name": "Error Trigger", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [1100, 500]}, {"parameters": {"respondWith": "json", "responseBody": "={\\n  \\"success\\": false,\\n  \\"error\\": \\"{{ $json.execution.error.message }}\\"\\n}", "options": {}}, "id": "2c86cb3b-9d1a-48f8-9d24-a2dc1378b1cb", "name": "Error Response", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [1350, 500]}], "connections": {"Webhook": {"main": [[{"node": "Route Action", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "Route Action": {"main": [[{"node"