ult.getValue());\\n    }\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"filePath\": \"src/modules/ai-content/adapters/hooks/report-mode/use-ai-actions.ts\",\n          \"descriptionOfChange\": \"Fix TanStack Query onError signature mismatch by wrapping handleError in an arrow function.\",\n          \"clarifyingQuestionIfAny\": null,\n          \"codeSnippetsToChange\": [\n            {\n              \"startLine\": 61,\n              \"endLine\": 72,\n              \"code\": \"  const handleError = (error: any, title?: string) => {\\n    // Attempt to extract structured error from n8n if available\\n    let description = error.message || \\\"An unexpected error occurred.\\\";\\n    if (error.response?.data?.error) {\\n      description = error.response.data.error;\\n    } else if (error.error?.message) {\\n      description = error.error.message;\\n    }\\n\\n    toast({\\n      title: title || t('builder.Section.aiActionFailed'),\\n      description,\\n      variant: 'destructive',\\n    });\\n  };\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"startLine\": 76,\n              \"endLine\": 87,\n              \"code\": \"    onSuccess: (data: any) => handleSuccess(data.manipulatedText),\\n    onError: (error: any) => handleError(error),\\n  });\\n\\n  const translateMutation = useMutation({\\n    mutationFn: async (variables: { text: string; targetLang: string }) => {\\n      await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 500));\\n      return { text: `[Translated to ${variables.targetLang}] This is a hardcoded translation for testing.` };\\n    },\\n    onSuccess: (data: any) => handleSuccess(data.text),\\n    onError: (error: any) => handleError(error),\\n  });\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"startLine\": 197,\n              \"endLine\": 247,\n              \"code\": \"    onError: (error: any) => {\\n      if (error.name === 'AbortError') return;\\n      handleError(error, 'Section Generation Error');\\n    },\\n  });\\