2026-04-07 05:08:56.775 | 18203 (18203) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "### Goals\nEnable \"Generate with RAG\" for sections and chapters in the builder UI by integrating new mutations and HUD controls.\n\n### Proposed Changes\n\n#### Hooks Layer\n- **File:** `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/hooks/report-mode/use-ai-actions.ts`\n    - Add `generateSectionWithRAGMutation` and `generateChapterWithRAGMutation`.\n    - Implement API calls to `/api/generate/section-rag` and `/api/generate/chapter-rag`.\n    - Ensure RAG-specific success/error handling and cache invalidation.\n\n#### UI Layer\n- **File:** `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/generation/SectionGenerationHUD.tsx`\n    - Add a `useState` for `useRAG` (defaulting to false).\n    - Insert a \"RAG Enhancement\" toggle switch next to the \"Generate\" button.\n    - Update `handleGenerateClick` to invoke the RAG mutation when enabled.\n    - Adjust `creditCost` display (RAG = 2x credits).\n\n- **File:** `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/generation/ChapterGenerationHUD.tsx`\n    - Add RAG toggle and mutation logic similar to the Section HUD.\n\n### Verification Plan\n- Toggle RAG mode in the Section HUD and verify the mutation calls `/api/generate/section-rag`.\n- Verify the credit cost indicator updates correctly in the UI.\n- Confirm successful generation content is applied to the project state.\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_481bb08c438b42e3a39265e24c14c5f9", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
