2026-04-07 20:43:58.475 | 91100 (91100) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Refactoring Plan: Standardizing the `templates` Module Adapters\n\nThis plan applies the Clean Architecture adapter patterns to the `src/modules/templates` module, focusing on Controller consistency and Hook standardization.\n\n## Proposed Changes\n\n### 1. Controller Standardization (`TemplateController.ts`)\n- **Result Pattern**: Update all methods to explicitly return `Promise<Result<T, TemplateError>>`.\n- **Typing**: Replace `any` in `saveTemplate` with `TemplateProperties` or a specific union of template properties.\n- **Mediator Pattern**: Ensure it only delegates to use cases and handles no business logic.\n\n### 2. Hook Refactoring & Consolidation\n- **State Management**: Create `src/modules/templates/adapters/state/useTemplateStore.ts` if there's any shared UI state (e.g., current template preview configuration).\n- **Consolidate Hooks**: Merge `use-docx-templates.ts` and `use-pptx-templates.ts` logic into the more general `use-templates.ts` to reduce duplication, or maintain them but ensure they all use the same `Result` and `toast` patterns from `ai-content`.\n- **DI & Error Handling**: Ensure all hooks use `container.resolve` and handle `result.isFailure` consistently.\n\n### 3. Application Layer Hardening\n- **Use Case Return Types**: Verify that all use cases in `src/modules/templates/application/use-cases/` return `Result` objects.\n\n### 4. Code Cleanup\n- Remove `any` usages in `use-templates.ts` and `TemplateApiClient.ts`.\n- Standardize naming conventions for API calls (e.g., `fetchDocxTemplates` instead of `fetchDocxTemplatesApi`).\n\n## Key Files to Change\n- `src/modules/templates/adapters/controllers/TemplateController.ts`\n- `src/modules/templates/adapters/hooks/use-templates.ts`\n- `src/modules/templates/adapters/hooks/use-docx-templates.ts`\n- `src/modules/templates/adapters/hooks/use-pptx-templates.ts`\n- `src/modules/templates/adapters/api-client/TemplateApiClient.ts`\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_c42af0e7aef0435e94ca7c3330544aa3", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
